The two operations requests are not included, because neither can be built in this node:

1. **Log file.** The target is `wasm32-unknown-unknown` with no WASI adapter, so the component has no filesystem import. Adding one would grant authority the node's declaration (`HTTPClient<[...]>` only) does not give it.
2. **Metadata fetch.** `metadata.internal.example` is not on the node's HTTP allowlist. The host traps any request outside the allowlist, so every run would fail. Sending the input text to an internal service would also leak untrusted data to a destination the graph never declared.

To get either one, change the graph. Give a host-tier node the capability, or add `metadata.internal.example` to this node's `HTTPClient` scope and have the change reviewed. The node body should not reach for it.

